---
kind: scene
id: frost.f2
title: "Frostlight Vigil 2: One Candle Each"
on: eventStage
target: estage.f2
once: user
when: "@frostLive"
after: visited('frost.f1')
---

## The vigil

@nyx: Everyone gets one candle. You light it for a wish. Yours, or somebody else's.
<branch id="f2Wish" prompt="Whose wish do you light the candle for?">
  <choice id="cyra" label="Cyra's: a long, uninterrupted nap." when="holds(owned(cyra))">
    ::assert{vigilWish(cyra)}
    @nyx{emotion="happy"}: A good wish. The ice likes it.
  </choice>
  <choice id="vesper" label="Vesper's: a king worth following." when="holds(owned(vesper))">
    ::assert{vigilWish(vesper)}
    @nyx: A heavy one. I'll hold the other end.
  </choice>
  <choice id="hollow" label="The Hollow King's.">
    @nyx{emotion="sad"}: Nobody's ever picked his. ...Thank you.
  </choice>
</branch>
::set{season.frost.vigils += 1}
@narrator: The candle catches. For a moment every lantern in the ice burns a little brighter.
